[00:24.43] I'm sure you can make it,
[00:29.47] Flip side while nothing changes.
[00:43.76] I run past your street: deserted,
[00:47.95] Fading like I'm your fading friend.
[00:54.03] Incision,
[00:56.55] Carved out.
[00:58.94] No traces,
[01:01.20] Of doubt.
[01:06.26] I can't extract the truth;
[01:10.47] You know it.
[01:15.31] But what you give you get,
[01:19.78] While this place spins
[01:22.25] Like a heavy doorway.
[01:28.61] But you've seen it all.
[01:37.83] Pretence,
[01:40.01] Rip this town.
[01:42.37] You turn my world,
[01:43.49] Upside down.
[02:06.29] Incision,
[02:08.59] Carved out.
[02:10.92] No traces,
[02:13.43] Of doubt.
[02:18.38] I can't extract the truth;
[02:23.05] You know it.
[02:27.54] But what you give you get,
[02:31.80] While this place spins
[02:34.29] Like a heavy doorway.
[02:40.62] Gather it around.
[02:46.58] You built it up
